{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トルティーヤくんだよ\nで何回でも思い出し笑いしちゃうカナヲだよ でゅふでゅふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/24/4122519/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おっと間違えた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは気持ち悪すぎる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/24/4122519/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日発売の\n『UTB Vol. 240』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以前『UTB＋』さんで\nらりんと愛未と撮影した時のアザーカット\n別冊付録の方に載ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/24/4122519/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな見てね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/24/4122519/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飯ぺろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チーズケーキとブラウニー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/24/4122519/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこかで見ました？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう！\nバレンタインの真夏の手作りです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/24/4122519/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんね～\nまた、みなさんが食べたくても\n食べられないものを紹介しますけども"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずね、\n見た目でわかると思うんだけど\n一般人の手作りのクオリティーじゃないんですよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パティシエですかって感じですよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スイーツって見た目がすごく難しいと思うの\nでも見た目がかなり重要なの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チーズケーキの表面に\nツヤがあってマーブルになってて\nこんなのお店でしか見たことない！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チーズケーキね\nまあフォークが止まらない！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで食べるやつだから\nちゃんと残しておかなきゃいけないのに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しすぎるんですよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生地はしっとり土台はさくさく\nたまらないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブラウニーは切り分けてあったから\nちゃんと我慢して1つだけ食べましたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/24/4122519/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アーモンドとくるみがざくざく入ってて\n食感が楽しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/24/4122519/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くどさやクセがない\n贅沢なブラウニーです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやー\n真夏は天才ですわ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}